Title:  Relationships among groups

Seq:    12.6.179.1.9

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Wilson, David Sloan|David Sloan Wilson]], 2019, from the book *[[This View of Life: Completing the Darwinian Revolution]]*

Timestamp: 20251218192020

Date Added: 2025-12-18 12:20:20 -0700

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Referenced In: Multicultural societies include diverse subgroups

Body:

In large societies that consist of many groups, relationships among groups must embody the same principles as the relationships among individuals within groups. This means that the [[Core Design Principles for the Efficacy of Groups|core design principles]] are *scale-independent*....

